Maintenance and Safety Report - March 2024

SYSTEM SAFETY RULE: If inverter_temperature_C exceeds 85.0C, the unit enters emergency shutdown. Readings for the 45 minutes immediately following such a spike must be invalidated.

System firmware update on Sakura Energy Site on the 16th of March from 08:00 to 12:00 local time. Status: COMPLETED.

Panel inspection on Sakura Energy Site on March 15th from 09:00 to 11:00 local time. CANCELLED due to heavy rain.

Scheduled cleaning at Vistula Photovoltaics on March 15, starting at 12:00 and finishing at 14:00 local time. Status: COMPLETED.

